/* book Worked example: Q: A port injector flows 240 cm³/min when fully open. The ECU holds it open for 5 ms. Find the fuel volume delivered in one injection in cm³ and mm³.
   1. Flow: 240 cm³/min ÷ 60 = 4 cm³/s; open time 5 ms = 0.005 s.
   2. Volume = 4 × 0.005 = 0.02 cm³ = 20 mm³ (1 cm³ = 1000 mm³).
   Answer: Fuel delivered per injection is 0.02 cm³, which is 20 mm³. */
